# Line-ending policy: every text file is stored AND checked out with LF,
# on every platform. This is load-bearing, not cosmetic: the benchmark's
# schema lock (SCHEMA_MAP_VERSIONS.json) pins the SHA-256 of SCHEMA_MAP.md,
# and a CRLF checkout (Windows default autocrlf) silently changes the bytes
# being hashed — the determinism firewall must not itself be
# platform-nondeterministic. (The hash is additionally computed over
# LF-normalised bytes in benchmarks/invariants.py as belt-and-braces.)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artefacts — never normalised.
*.joblib binary
*.pkl binary
*.pt binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.xlsx binary
